---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Products · LatentSig" description="Explore LatentSig's two product directions: annotation and verification, and agentic AI.">
  <section class="catalog-hero"><div><p>LATENTSIG PRODUCTS</p><h1>Two platforms. Built around practical work.</h1><span>Explore annotation and verification, and our agentic AI platform. Product availability is stated on each page.</span></div></section>
  <section class="catalog"><div class="catalog-grid">
    <a class="catalog-card" href="/products/annotation-verification/"><div class="catalog-art annotation-catalog" aria-hidden="true"><div class="catalog-data-stack"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="catalog-review-card"><b>VERIFY</b><span></span><span></span><span></span><i>✓</i></div><small>DATA → LABELS → REVIEW</small></div><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT</small><h2>Annotation &amp; Verification Platform</h2><p>From raw data to reviewed, reliable datasets.</p><span class="catalog-link">Explore product ↗</span></a>
    <a class="catalog-card" href="/products/agentic-ai-platform/"><div class="catalog-art agent-catalog" aria-hidden="true"><div class="catalog-agent-core">TASK</div><div class="catalog-agent-orbit"><i>PLAN</i><i>TOOL</i><i>CHECK</i><i>RESULT</i></div><div class="catalog-agent-path"></div><small>REQUEST → ORCHESTRATION → OUTCOME</small></div><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT</small><h2>Agentic AI Platform</h2><p>Make AI workflows easier to reason about.</p><span class="catalog-link">Explore product ↗</span></a>
  </div><p class="catalog-note">These are product directions. Concept illustrations do not depict a working product interface.</p><p class="catalog-note">Looking for web or mobile application design and development? <a href="/solutions/web-mobile-apps/">Explore our application solutions ↗</a></p></section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .catalog-hero{padding:95px 24px 70px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 0,#41388355,transparent 52%),#0b1020;color:#f4f2ff}.catalog-hero>div,.catalog-grid,.catalog-note{max-width:1240px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.catalog-hero p,.catalog-card small{color:#c0c1ff;font:700 11px Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.15em}.catalog-hero h1{max-width:850px;margin:17px 0;font:600 clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5.2rem)/1.02 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.catalog-hero span{font:16px/1.7 Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#bcbacf}.catalog{padding:30px 24px 90px;background:#0b1020;color:#f4f2ff}.catalog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.catalog-card{padding:14px 14px 24px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #35394e;background:#11182a;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}.catalog-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#8986cf}.catalog-art{height:205px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:22px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,#40397666,transparent 70%),#0b1020;color:#d9d6ff;font:600 10px Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.07em}.catalog-art.annotation{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px}.catalog-art.annotation span{padding:12px 10px;border:1px solid #68639e;border-radius:5px;background:#151b31}.catalog-art.annotation b{color:#b2adff}.catalog-art.agents{flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.agent-node{padding:10px 18px;border:1px solid #6b66a1;border-radius:50px;background:#171c35}.catalog-art.agents i{font-style:normal;color:#c0c1ff}.catalog-art.apps{gap:20px}.app-window{width:48%;height:125px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #676493;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#201e42,#11172a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.app-window.mobile{width:66px;height:135px;border-radius:13px}.catalog-card h2{font:600 22px/1.2 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;margin:12px 0}.catalog-card p{font:14px/1.6 Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#b7b5c9;min-height:44px}.catalog-link{display:block;margin-top:20px;color:#c0c1ff;font:700 13px Geist,system-ui,sans-serif}.catalog-note{color:#9392aa;font:12px/1.6 Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;margin-top:20px}
  .catalog-art{position:relative;height:clamp(190px,24vw,300px);overflow:hidden;border-radius:9px;margin-bottom:22px}.catalog-art>small{position:absolute;left:15px;bottom:13px;color:#e5e2da!important;font-size:8px!important;letter-spacing:.12em!important}.annotation-catalog{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:26px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 50%,#40514d,#1c2528 68%)}.catalog-data-stack{position:relative;width:40%;height:55%;border:1px solid #82928a;border-radius:8px;background:#52645b;transform:perspective(500px) rotateY(-18deg);box-shadow:0 18px 32px #10181755}.catalog-data-stack:before,.catalog-data-stack:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:9px;border:1px solid #d4cc9f88;border-radius:5px}.catalog-data-stack:after{inset:28px 20px 20px 40px;border-color:#b096d899}.catalog-data-stack i{position:absolute;width:22px;height:14px;border:1px solid #9ed3ae;border-radius:2px}.catalog-data-stack i:nth-child(1){left:16%;top:20%}.catalog-data-stack i:nth-child(2){left:55%;top:34%;border-color:#b497e4}.catalog-data-stack i:nth-child(3){left:33%;top:62%}.catalog-data-stack i:nth-child(4){right:14%;bottom:13%;border-color:#e2c47e}.catalog-data-stack i:nth-child(5){left:8%;bottom:15%;width:11px;height:22px}.catalog-review-card{position:relative;width:30%;display:grid;gap:9px;padding:15px 13px;border:1px solid #62706a;border-radius:7px;background:#263136;color:#e2e9e3;box-shadow:0 14px 26px #10181755}.catalog-review-card b{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.1em}.catalog-review-card span{height:5px;border-radius:4px;background:#5c6b68}.catalog-review-card i{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;color:#bbd6a5;font-size:12px;font-style:normal}.agent-catalog{display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,#353147,#1d2028 72%);color:#ece9f4}.catalog-agent-core{z-index:2;display:grid;place-items:center;width:74px;height:74px;border:1px solid #a18ec1;border-radius:50%;background:#343142;box-shadow:0 0 0 12px #9684bd16;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em}.catalog-agent-orbit{position:absolute;inset:16% 20%;border:1px solid #8c7ca759;border-radius:50%;animation:catalog-orbit 18s linear infinite}.catalog-agent-orbit i{position:absolute;display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:24px;border:1px solid #776b90;border-radius:5px;background:#302f3c;color:#dbd3eb;font-size:7px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:.08em}.catalog-agent-orbit i:nth-child(1){top:-12px;left:calc(50% - 24px)}.catalog-agent-orbit i:nth-child(2){right:-24px;top:calc(50% - 12px)}.catalog-agent-orbit i:nth-child(3){bottom:-12px;left:calc(50% - 24px)}.catalog-agent-orbit i:nth-child(4){left:-24px;top:calc(50% - 12px)}.catalog-agent-path{position:absolute;width:40%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#c8b7ee,transparent);animation:catalog-signal 3s linear infinite}@keyframes catalog-orbit{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes catalog-signal{from{transform:translateX(-40%);opacity:0}40%{opacity:1}to{transform:translateX(40%);opacity:0}}
  @media(max-width:820px){.catalog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.catalog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.catalog-card p{min-height:0}.catalog{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}.catalog-art{height:220px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.catalog-agent-orbit,.catalog-agent-path{animation:none}}
</style>
